<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30952" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nī^gro</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. n. and <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a.</i> [id.]. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Neutr., to be black</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ea, quae nigrant nigro de semine nata,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					2, 733</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Act., to make black, to blacken</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mgrāsset sibi planctu lacertos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					S. 2, 6, 83</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to make dark, to
				darken</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nigrati ignorantiae tenebris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Marc. 4, 8</span></i>
			.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nī^grans</span></b> , antis, <i>P. a., black, dark-colored, dusky</i>: nigrantia
			boum cornua,
			 Varr R. R. 2, 5: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nigrantes terga juvenci,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 5, 97</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nigrantes alae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					2, 535</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nigrantes domos ammarum intrāsse
					silentūm,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop. 3, 12, 33</span></i>
			 (4, 11, 33): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nigrante profundo,</span>”
				<i>the sea</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					17, 258</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">litora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 4, 697</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aegis,</span>”
				i. e. <i>that produces clouds</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 8, 353</span></i>
			.</div>
